  "title": "Lua: Check and warn about unregistered ProtoFields in add_packet_field",
  "description": "Lua ProtoFields have to be registered via adding to a Proto.fields\nattribute, which is only implicitly alluded to in the documentation.\nAdd some explicit references.\n\nAdd a more Lua specific error when a ProtoField has not be registered\nvia adding to a Proto.fields, which should make it a bit clearer how\nto fix in Lua than the error message from the C API of 'failed assertion\n\"(guint)hfindex < gpa_hfinfo.len\" (Unregistered hf!)'\n\nFix #13033. (The other issues mentioned there have already been fixed,\ne.g. by 6659f4494d1dd313ef4d9f69f7e0b6194cc3e6b2, with the exception\nof something with a more specific issue in #18008).",
